def top_n_by_category(records, n):
    groups = defaultdict(list)
    for r in records:
        groups[r["cat"]].append(r)
    return {
        cat: sorted(items, key=lambda r: -r["value"])[:n]
        for cat, items in groups.items()
    }
```

这就是"每个分组取 Top N"的经典写法；在 SQL 中对应窗口函数 `ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY ...)`。

